flowchart TD
    Start([host start service]) --> ParseService[Parse service argument]

    ParseService --> CheckType{Service type?}

    CheckType -->|caddy| StartCaddy[CaddyManager.start]
    CheckType -->|php-version| ExtractVersion[Extract PHP version]
    CheckType -->|unknown| UnknownError[Error: Unknown service]

    ExtractVersion --> StartPhp[PhpManager.start version]

    StartCaddy --> CheckResult{Success?}
    StartPhp --> CheckResult
    UnknownError --> FailExit([Failure])

    CheckResult -->|Yes| ReportSuccess[Info: Started service]
    CheckResult -->|No| ReportFailure[Error: Failed to start]

    ReportSuccess --> SuccessExit([Success])
    ReportFailure --> FailExit
